Contact:	Miru kernel maintainers
Description:
		OnePlus OSwap 2.0 controls and statistics attached to each zram
		device.  Userspace configures the loop backing device through
		hybridswap_loop_device, enables the extent-backed core through
		hybridswap_core_enable, and controls background reclaim through
		hybridswap_enable and hybridswap_swapd_pause.  The remaining files
		expose donor-compatible lifetime, quota, capacity, and telemetry
		controls consumed by ColorOS 14 memory services.

